# evidence/ is NOT ignored: history.jsonl is the point of the repository.
# evidence/refutations.jsonl is written by `make refute` and IS committed: a repository that
# invites refutation should show the refutations it has already survived. It never backs a
# published number either way.

# `npm install` in the mermaid step of .github/workflows/fast.yml writes it here. Nothing
# in this repository is a node package; the directory is a tool's scratch space, and an
# untracked one is enough to make `git status --porcelain` call the tree dirty.
node_modules/
